# App Store Metadata Audit Checklist (Guideline 2.3)

> **Purpose:** Pre-submission audit to prevent common "Metadata Rejected" statuses.
> **Based on:** Apple App Store Review Guidelines (Section 2.3)

---

## 1. Visual Assets (Screenshots & Previews)

### 📸 Screenshots (Guideline 2.3.3)
- [ ] **Actual UI:** Do screenshots show the *actual app* in use? (Marketing art without UI is a rejection).
- [ ] **Device Specific:** Are iPhone images on iPhone frames, iPad on iPad frames? (No stretching).
- [ ] **Status Bars:** Are status bars clean/full battery or removed entirely?
- [ ] **No "Coming Soon":** Do screenshots show features that are actually in the build?

### 🎥 App Previews
- [ ] **Footage Only:** Is the preview primarily captured footage of the app?
- [ ] **No Over-Editing:** Avoid excessive special effects that obscure the UI.

---

## 2. Text Metadata

### 🏷️ Name & Subtitle (Guideline 2.3.7)
- [ ] **Unique:** Is the name unique and not leveraging other trademarked terms?
- [ ] **No Prices:** Does the subtitle contain pricing info (e.g., "Free", "$0.99")? (Strictly forbidden).
- [ ] **Value Prop:** Does the subtitle describe *what it does* rather than generic marketing fluff?

### 📝 Description (Guideline 2.3)
- [ ] **First 3 Lines:** Does the opening clearly state what the app does?
- [ ] **No URL Shorteners:** Are all links full and visible?
- [ ] **No Pricing:** description should not reference specific pricing (use IAP section for that).
- [ ] **No Android References:** Absolutely no mention of "Android", "Play Store", or other platforms.

### 🔑 Keywords
- [ ] **No Competitors:** No unauthorized competitor names.
- [ ] **No Categories:** Don't waste keywords on "App", "Free", or category names (automatic).

---

## 3. Review Information (Guideline 2.1)

### 🕵️‍♂️ Demo Account
- [ ] **Provided:** Is a generic demo account (username/password) provided in App Review Information?
- [ ] **Working:** Did you test these credentials on the *production* build recently?
- [ ] **2FA Disabled:** Is 2FA disabled for this demo user?

### 🗒️ Notes to Reviewer
- [ ] **Explanation:** If a feature isn't obvious, is it explained here?
- [ ] **Video Link:** If the app requires special hardware, is a demo video link provided?

---

## 4. Common Rejection Traps

- [ ] **"Beta" Label:** The app must not be labeled "Beta" or "Demo" anywhere in metadata or binary.
- [ ] **Unfinished Content:** No "Lorem Ipsum" or placeholder text in the final build.
- [ ] **Empty Sections:** No empty "News" or "Updates" sections if there's no content.
- [ ] **Broken Links:** Privacy Policy and Support URLs must be live and valid.
